    "answer": {
      "short": "6670 km",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{array}{rrrrr}&6&4&3&6\\\\+&&2&3&4\\\\\\hline&6&6&7&0\\end{array}$$\n\n$6+4=10$: write 0 ones and carry 1 ten. The tens total is $3+3+1=7$; the hundreds total is $4+2=6$.\n\nThe Nile is 6670 km long.",
